lling novels few things left unsaid that's the way we met it started with a friend request sorry you're not mytype you're the password to my life you're trending in my dreams sheswiped right into my heart and all rights reserved for you he is the recipientof youth achievers award and has been featured on the forbes india longlist ofthe most influential celebrities for three consecutive years he also writes fortelevision and has given guest lectures in various renowned institutes like iitsand organizations like tedx his books have been translated in variouslanguages like hindi marathi gujarati and telugu
