__label__books law relating to intellectual property rights about the author dr v k ahuja is associate professor in faculty of law university of delhi having a teaching experience of over 23 years he holds ll m and ph d from university of delhi and m phil from jnu new delhi he has also completed a certificate course on law teaching and legal research skills at cardiff law school cardiff university uk in 2004 he has authored three books on i pr and two volumes of halsbury's annotated statutes of india he was honoured with an award in the fifth south asian teaching session on international humanitarian law and refugee law organised jointly by the international committee of the red cross united nations high commissioner for refugees and national law school of india university bangalore in 2003
